    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Prime Town Centre Mixed-Use Property comprising a self-contained ground floor commercial unit with first & second floor residential accommodation.\r\n\r\n100 Main Street (Formerly Black's Newsagents) opposite Dunnes Stores offers a rare opportunity to acquire an extensive and prominent mixed-use property in the commercial heart of Cavan Town, benefiting from prime visibility, established footfall, and immediate access to the town's key amenities & services. \r\n\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\nCavan Town is the principal commercial centre in the county & serves a substantial catchment area across the Midlands and Border region with prime accessibility North and South via the N3 & excellent public transport.  \r\nThe property occupies a strategic position on Main Street, placing it within walking distance of: \r\n•\tShopping, cafés, restaurants and hospitality venues  \r\n•\tMedical and professional services  \r\n•\tPublic transport connections  \r\n•\tSchools & educational facilities  \r\n•\tPublic parking facilities - street and nearby car parks  \r\n \r\n Suitable For: \r\n•\tPrivate Investors  \r\n•\tOwner Occupiers  \r\n•\tDevelopers  \r\n•\tMixed-Use Asset Managers"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor Commercial: 112 m²\r\n\r\nRetail shop Floor 1: 4.5m x 6.7m \r\nRear retail store area: 4.1m x 6.7m \r\nBER: E, BER No. 801166125\r\n\r\nRetail Space 2: 14.3m x 4.2m (inc. WC to rear) \r\nBER: D, BER No. 801165911\r\n\r\n \r\nResidential Accommodation: (First & Second Floors) \r\nBER: E, BER No. 119623445\r\n\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR \r\nLiving Room1:  3.3m x 3.9m w/ feature fireplace  \r\nLiving Room 2:  3.2m x 3.9m w/ feature fireplace \r\nBedroom 1: 3.2m x 3.6m \r\nBedroom 2:  3.8m x 4.1m\r\nBedroom 3: 4.4m x 4.2m\r\nBathroom: 1.8m x 1.8m inc. WHB, W.C, Shower \r\nKitchen:  2.9m x 3.2m  \r\n \r\nSECOND FLOOR \r\nBedroom 1: 3.2m x 3.9m \r\nBedroom 2: 3.3m x 3.7m \r\nBedroom 3:  3m x 3.1m \r\nBathroom: 2m x 2.9m inc. WHB, W.C, Bath \r\nShelved Hot Press & Storage areas  \r\n \r\nFirst Floor Total Area: c.83 m² \r\nSecond Floor Total Area: c.50 m²"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime Town Centre Extensive Mixed-Use Property \r\nSpacious self-contained ground floor commercial unit with first & second floor residential accommodation.\r\nLocated in the commercial heart of Cavan Town with prime visibility on both Main St. and Ashe St. \r\nEstablished footfall & immediate access to the town's key amenities & services. \r\nExcellent accessibility \r\nNearby car parks and transport links \r\nClose to Schools & educational facilities  \r\nBeside shopping, cafés, restaurants and hospitality venues"
